--- HISSA 2: FAILURE AUDIT KE FIX ---

  Ye wo dikkatein theen jo abhi dikhti nahi thi, par kisi din data
  gayab kar sakti theen ya dashboard band kar sakti theen.

  1. DASHBOARD KI COLLECTION PEHLE KHAALI HOTI THI
     Har ghante ke push me 2-3 second ke liye collection khaali rehti
     thi -- us pal jo dashboard kholta, use 500 error milta. Aur agar
     us pal Mongo girta ya disk bharti, to collection HAMESHA ke liye
     khaali reh jaati aur dashboard poora band ho jaata.
     AB: naya data alag naam me banta hai, ginti milti hai, phir
     rename se swap. Khaali window ab hai hi nahi.

  2. PUSH FAIL HO JAAYE TO DATA HAMESHA KE LIYE ATAK JAATA THA
     Files "ho gayi" mark ho jaati thi push se PEHLE. Push fail hua to
     agle run me "Naya data nahi" bol kar skip -- tweets Mongo me pade
     rehte, dashboard par kabhi nahi aate. Bina kisi warning ke.
     AB: push poora hone par hi mark hota hai, aur adhoora reh jaaye
     to agla run khud dobara push kar deta hai.

  3. AADHA UPDATE -- ALL INDIA NAYA, UP PURANA
     All-India ka stamp UP se pehle lagta tha. UP fail hua to UP
     chupchap purana data dikhata rehta, uska "last updated" bhi nahi
     badalta -- kisi ko shaq tak nahi hota.
     AB: dono ban jaane ke BAAD hi dono ka stamp lagta hai.

  4. BACKUP PURANA BACKUP MITA DETA THA
     Backup file pehle khaali hoti thi phir bharti thi. Beech me
     network/Mongo gira to purana bhi gaya aur naya bhi adhoora. Aur
     ye "backup skip" likh kar nigal liya jaata tha.
     AB: .part file me banta hai, poora hone par rename. Purani copy
     .prev me rehti hai. Fail ho to SAAF dikhta hai.

  5. MAPPING FILE KHARAB HO SAKTI THI
     handle_master.json likhte waqt crash hua to file aadhi reh jaati,
     aur phir pipeline HAR run par wahin marta. Saara handle mapping
     chala jaata.
     AB: temp file + rename (atomic), aur ek .prev copy. Kharab mile
     to .prev se chal jaata hai.

  6. HAR REQUEST PAR NAYA DB CONNECTION (35 jagah)
     Pooling ka fayda poora khatam tha. 7 jagah timeout bhi nahi tha
     -- Mongo band ho to dashboard 30 SECOND latka rehta tha.
     AB: ek hi saanjha pool, sab jagah ek jaisa timeout (6 sec).

  7. CONNECTION LEAK
     Error aane par kai jagah connection kabhi band hi nahi hota tha.
     AB: pool hai, ye dikkat hi nahi rahi.

  8. 6 MB PAGE KA GZIP MAIN THREAD ROK DETA THA
     Jab tak compress hota, poora server ruka rehta -- 3-4 log ek
     saath kholein to sab atak jaate. Yahi "server hang" ki wajah thi.
     AB: async gzip, main thread khaali.

  9. SERVER PAR KOI TIMEOUT NAHI THA
     ngrok se public hai -- ek atki connection hamesha socket pakad
     kar baith sakti thi.
     AB: headers/request/keep-alive teeno par timeout.

 10. CRASH HONE PAR SIRF LOG HOTA THA
     Server adhi-tooti haalat me chalta rehta, kisi ko pata nahi.
     AB: Express error middleware (stack trace ab user ko nahi
     dikhta), aur /healthz -- ek line me poori sehat:
         http://localhost:3000/healthz
     Mongo zinda hai? data kitna purana hai? collection khaali to
     nahi? sab ek jagah.

 11. pipeline.log KABHI SAAF NAHI HOTA THA
     AB: 5 MB par rotate (do peedhi rakhi jaati hain). Aur likhne se
     pehle disk ki jagah bhi dekh li jaati hai.

 12. PASSWORD SAADE TEXT ME THE
     Code me bhi, Mongo me bhi, aur admin panel unhe dikha bhi deta
     tha. Database ka backup = sabka password.
     AB: scrypt hash. Purane password apne aap hash me badal jaate
     hain jab user agli baar login karta hai -- kisi ko kuch nahi
     karna. Panel se password dikhna band.
     Code me likhe 5 base account ab bhi saade hain -- unke liye
     DASHBOARD folder me:   node make_pw_hash.js

 13. LOGIN PAR KOI ROK NAHI THI
     Koi bhi unlimited password aazma sakta tha.
     AB: 15 min me ek email par 8 aur ek IP se 20 galat koshishon ke
     baad 10 min ka viraam. Sahi login par hisaab saaf.

 14. SERVER RESTART = SABKA LOGOUT
     Aur ulta: account band karne par bhi uska access 12 ghante
     chalta rehta tha.
     AB: secret file me rehta hai (restart par logout nahi), aur
     cookie me waqt likha hai -- account band / password badalte hi
     purani cookie usi pal mar jaati hai.

 15. PIPELINE FAIL HONE PAR KUCH DIKHTA NAHI THA
     Traceback screen par upar chala jaata, agle ghante sab normal
     dikhta.
     AB: START_LIVE.bat ki window LAAL ho jaati hai aur lagatar
     kitni baar fail hua wo ginti dikhti hai.


